config BTRFS_ASSERT
	bool "Btrfs assert support"
	depends on BTRFS_FS
	help
	  Enable run-time assertion checking.  This will result in panics if
	  any of the assertions trip.  This is meant for btrfs developers only.

	  If unsure, say N.

